# ST7789 controller tests

Exercises the reset and initialisation transcript, the pixel format, RGB565
window addressing including a panel offset, bounded chunked fills, packed-region
validation, backlight ordering, refresh answering without sending, and transport
failure, against a recording MCU platform without physical hardware.
